The keepers sees their chance. Now it's a race against time to get him to the vet at the nearby stockade.
守者见其机. 现在,这是一场竞技 与时间,让他到兽医 在附近的储存。

85
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:41,000
The poor little calf is severely malnourished and dehydrated. The only hope is to try and get him to drink something.
可怜的小犊子严重营养不良,脱水. 唯一希望就是让他喝点东西

86
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:47,000
There are some rehydration fluids and although desperately weak, he manages to suck.
有一些补液 虽然非常虚弱 他还是能吸

