00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:05,000
This little bull urgently needs to go up to the orphanage in Nairobi where he can get intensive care in purpose-filled stables.
这只小公牛急需前往内罗毕的孤儿院,在那里,他可以在专用的马厩里获得重症监护.

